<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, MAY 13.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, MAY 13.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Tuesday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	May 13	May 12   Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  270.980     270.500     247.020    9.70 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  310.540     310.520     306.830    1.21 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  159.595     159.930     158.970    0.39 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   47.344	47.434	47.182    0.34 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  440.380     437.600     419.180    5.06 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  141.885     142.170     141.685    0.14 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.126	16.120	16.185   -0.36 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  227.500     228.000     212.430    7.09 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.889	 1.891	 1.888    0.05 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.576	 1.587	 1.581   -0.32 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  188.885     189.655     183.135    3.14 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
